<Base title="ETABS + AutoCAD Building Model — Build Spec" description="A complete, executable build spec for a 10-storey RC residential building in ETABS and AutoCAD: grid and story data, section and material definitions, load patterns and the four required combinations, BNBC 2020 seismic and wind parameters, and three worked hand checks (column axial, three-span beam moments, base shear) with a live calculator that re-derives every number from your own A, B and C.">

