<header class="hd">
  <div class="hd-tag">Structural Design Project &middot; ETABS + AutoCAD &middot; Serial No. 2</div>
  <h1>Building Model Build Spec</h1>
  <p class="hd-sub">Everything you need to build the 10-storey RC frame yourself &mdash; grid, stories,
  sections, loads, the four combinations, BNBC 2020 lateral parameters &mdash; plus three hand checks
  worked all the way to numbers so you can tell whether ETABS is doing what you think it is.</p>
  <div class="hd-pills">
    <span class="pill">A = 21&prime; &middot; B = 18&prime; &middot; C = 11&prime;</span>
    <span class="pill">10 storeys + GB</span>
    <span class="pill">BNBC 2020</span>
    <span class="pill">Live re-calculation</span>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="parambar">
  <div class="pf"><label>A (ft)</label><input id="pA" type="number" step="0.5" value="21"></div>
  <div class="pf"><label>B (ft)</label><input id="pB" type="number" step="0.5" value="18"></div>
  <div class="pf"><label>C (ft)</label><input id="pC" type="number" step="0.5" value="11"></div>
  <div class="pf"><label>Storeys</label><input id="pN" type="number" step="1" value="10"></div>
  <p class="note">Your serial number sets A, B and C. Change them and every table, diagram and
  check on this page re-derives. Defaults are S/N&nbsp;2.</p>
</div>

